<title>USA: Whitney Point CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</title>
<headline>Whitney Point CSD, N.Y., won by Roosevelt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roosevelt &amp; Cross Inc., said it won $3.688 million of Whitney Point CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.2974 percent.</p>
</text>
